<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"!!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I heard it! There was no way I'd misheard!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be the voice of the wind?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No! That was the voice of a living person!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I slowly turned my head toward where the voice had come from.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎幽霊バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\dark_attack.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n40\r\n300\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n40\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Gyaaah!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Waaaah!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\危機.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">It showed up! It really showed up! A real ghost, at last!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now I can knock logic-obsessed </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> down a peg!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Pointless thoughts like that popped into my head.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="6">, what happened!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE>, it showed up! It showed up! <STYLE ID="7">Ojisan</STYLE>'s ghost!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh...? </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> turned her eyes to </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who was sitting on the ground.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こうたろう">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what're you doing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "300" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Haah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Ah, that gave me a scare..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こうたろう">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ThinkingTime.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎腰に手バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"No, no, sorry I scared you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s ghost stood up on its own two legs and offered an </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="わ">apology</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for frightening us.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こうたろう">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> Niimura, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s older twin brother. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">No, no, I only meant it as a little prank, but I got startled too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"U-Uh-huh..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">So he was </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">older brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I had a feeling I'd heard there was someone like that.</STYLE><PG>
"Oh, nice to meet you! I'm Natsumi Kogori!
{PAUSE ""}
　Uh... 
{PAUSE ""}
Thank you... for the welcome... 
{PAUSE ""}
Um, the girl's voice earlier, that was you too, <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こうたろう">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">-san</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Huh? A girl...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All at once, the smile vanished from </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こうたろう">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="10">"What are you talking about... Come on, no voice of mine could ever be mistaken for a girl's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No way...! Then that voice just now...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">... You're there, aren't you?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ジャンプ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "800" "-500" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n540\r\n300\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\草の上に落とす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n140\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n140\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
"Whoa!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Way to go, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">! You totally knew I was here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A small figure was calling </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こうたろう">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> Daddy and beaming an innocent smile at him.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="13">, nice to meet you! I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こうたろう"> Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'s second daughter, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> Niimura!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　Age, 10! A fresh young thing in my teens!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, as the girl was called, greeted me in an </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="な">over</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">ly </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="な">familiar</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh... um, nice to meet you..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Whoaaa...! </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="13">, your face is so small and cute! You're totally popular with guys, right!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　Hey, hey, how do you get a face that small!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> fired off questions way beyond her age.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This girl, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, had odd eyes, one blue and one green.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Argh, come on! Why is everybody in the Niimura family such a weirdo!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Can't you just welcome guests like normal people for once!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There were too many way-too-quirky new characters for my head to keep up...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"C'mon, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="6">, over here. You're already tired, and dealing with these guys will just wear you out more."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "450" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, no fair! You're trying to keep </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="13"> all to yourself, aren't you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Brats</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> shouldn't run their mouths! We're beat from a long trip here!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, your mouth is sooo foul! That's why guys don't like you!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　I don't think the no-nonsense type is supposed to be like that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Shut it! Keep quiet, you damn </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, red in the face, was arguing with a </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">child</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'd thought this </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> girl might be like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She had no manners, or rather, she got way too close to people, and she was less endearing than </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Uh... it's awfully noisy out here... What happened...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the corner of the veranda, a still-pale </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> poked her head out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Ah... that's...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And the moment she saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s eyes lit up.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げる.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Ah, could this be </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> was right, she's <TXSPS>soooooooooooo<TXSPN> cuuute!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
